{
  "name": "Capstone — Pengingat Dosen (Email & WhatsApp)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Capstone — Pengingat dosen (F49–F57)\n\n1. Ubah **base_url** pada node *Konfigurasi* ke URL aplikasi Capstone.\n2. Buat kredensial **Header Auth** bernama `Capstone Automation Token`: Name `X-Automation-Token`, Value = isi `AUTOMATION_TOKEN` di `.env`.\n3. Buat kredensial **Header Auth** bernama `Fonnte Token`: Name `Authorization`, Value = token perangkat Fonnte.\n4. Buat kredensial **SMTP** bernama `SMTP Capstone`, lalu ubah alamat pengirim di node *Kirim email*.\n5. Isi `N8N_REMINDER_WEBHOOK_URL` di `.env` dengan Production URL node *Pemicu manual* agar reminder manual admin langsung terkirim.\n\nBackend menentukan pekerjaan yang belum selesai, ambang waktu, dan mencegah duplikat. Workflow ini hanya mengirim lalu melaporkan hasilnya.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e62baf5e-6f8b-4244-ad62-9be12f5d6af2",
      "name": "Catatan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "6ce128ab-1c1f-44c6-a03e-a7b1b0c42187",
      "name": "Setiap jam",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "capstone-reminder",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "61bfab23-cbfc-426e-9454-f3099d5a067d",
      "name": "Pemicu manual",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Capstone Automation Token"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "74b5444c-d98c-420c-a8c8-ae34b6cc8275"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "4501ea50-a5e0-4c27-b5be-57273425b60b",
              "name": "base_url",
              "value": "https://capstone.example.ac.id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "limit",
              "name": "limit",
              "value": 50,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "343b795a-cc63-4454-9618-55776fbde9e2",
      "name": "Konfigurasi",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.base_url }}/api/automation/reminders/claim",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ limit: $json.limit }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6e3845df-9515-43ae-a3ba-8e33816a64b8",
      "name": "Ambil antrean",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Capstone Automation Token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "275e9916-18e6-403c-8d3c-0e48399eabf5",
      "name": "Pecah antrean",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "dfc4c765-2b8b-46c4-9887-83b79e63f61e",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.channel }}",
              "rightValue": "email",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2900675f-404f-424b-9604-040064e82b84",
      "name": "Kanal email?",
